<section class="receipt-section wrap" aria-labelledby="receipt-title">
  <div class="section-heading receipt-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The definition of done</p><h2 id="receipt-title">Treat delivery<br /><span>as an evidence chain.</span></h2><p>A branch shows work exists. Checks show it behaves. Review shows the risk was examined. Merge proof and a post-merge check show the result arrived. Railyard carries that whole chain in one receipt.</p></div>
  <div class="terminal" aria-label="Example Railyard delivery receipt">
    <div class="terminal-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span><b>railyard / receipt</b></div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <p><i>$</i> <strong>railyard deliver</strong> <mark>“ship the retry fix”</mark></p>
      <p class="muted">routing <span>implementation</span> · effort max</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> plan → implementation → review</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> independent correctness + quality lenses</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> pull request checks settled</p>
      <p><b class="check">✓</b> merge reachable from <code>main</code></p>
      <p class="receipt-result"><span>post-merge proof</span><strong>verified</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
